---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" description="Selected experience and resume download for Anusha Dharmasena.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-10 pt-16 md:pb-14 md:pt-24">
    <div class="surface-card-strong rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Resume</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.06em] text-white md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.96]">
            Selected experience, current roles, and a straightforward PDF.
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300 md:text-xl">
            The short version: strong front-end and product instincts, solid engineering foundations, and a bias towards
            software that stays maintainable under real use.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/resume/anusha-dharmasena-resume.pdf" class="button-primary whitespace-nowrap">Download PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-8 md:py-10">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="surface-card rounded-[2rem] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">Current work</h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">David Jones:</span> tech lead work across digital delivery, execution quality, and technical judgement.</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Lithodomos:</span> product and engineering work on the Ancient World web app.</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold text-white">Personal products:</span> ongoing work on Fiscava, pantry-ping, and other smaller tools.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-card rounded-[2rem] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">Earlier grounding</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Canon work in Japan gave me a deep engineering base in PDF, SVG, print, and systems that do not tolerate sloppy
          thinking. That background still shows up in how I approach front-end architecture and delivery work now.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">Core strengths</h2>
        <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
          <div class="pill justify-center text-center">TypeScript and JavaScript product development</div>
          <div class="pill justify-center text-center">Front-end architecture and maintainability</div>
          <div class="pill justify-center text-center">Product delivery and technical leadership</div>
          <div class="pill justify-center text-center">Practical systems thinking and UX judgement</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
